     1998   define  temp-table temp-pers-proc no-undo
     1999   field proc-name as character
     2000   field vproc-handle as handle
     2001   field vparent-handle as handle
     2002   field user-name as character
     2003   field id as integer
     2004   field vpar as character
     2005   field rank-to-delete as integer
     2006   index pi is unique primary
     2007   proc-name
     2008   id
     2009   index puser
     2010   proc-name
     2011   user-name
     2012   index ppar
     2013   proc-name
     2014   vpar
